; WHO 4 thermoregulation: the WHERE forms a gateway forwards (the 3..99 boundary, zero-padded,
; 3- and 4-digit, control-unit, interface and local-bus forms), as a status request
; (*#4*WHERE##), as a command (*4*303*WHERE##) and as a dimension request (*#4*WHERE*0##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same 43 WHERE
; forms in all three series.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: frames of this file crash a daemon on at least one emulated gateway; do not send
; them to a real gateway.

; 1. *#4*WHERE## (status request)
;    forwarded by all 13
